### ============================================================
### 59-OpenCSV CSV Import & Export API Testing (Port: 8159)
### ============================================================

### 1. Xuất danh sách sản phẩm ra tệp CSV (StatefulBeanToCsv)
GET http://localhost:8159/api/csv/export
Accept: text/csv

### 2. Nhập dữ liệu sản phẩm từ tệp CSV (CsvToBean)
# Đính kèm file CSV trong form-data multipart
POST http://localhost:8159/api/csv/import
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="products.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

name,price,category
"Mechanical Keyboard, RGB",129.99,Electronics
"Ergonomic Chair",250.00,Furniture
--boundary--
